SCOPE — what "the Software" means here

The MIT licence above covers the CODE ONLY:

    src/app_shell.html      the app: markup, stylesheet, JavaScript
    src/build.py            the builder
    src/sync.sh             the sync helper

It does NOT cover the QUESTION CONTENT — the questions, answers and
step-by-step working chains:

    src/questions.json
    src/extra.json
    src/working.json

nor the generated files that embed that content (index.html,
maths-question-bank.html, working-yr*.js), which are MIT only as to the app
code they carry.

No licence is granted on the question content; all rights reserved. See
"Provenance" in README.md for where it comes from.
